# UCOS-GOV-006 (GOV-005 §5.1/§6.8) — formally declare generated evidence and
# editor/office lock files as NON-ARTIFACTS bounded by version control. Generated
# evidence is deterministically re-derivable output (regenerated each run), not a
# registerable repository artifact; ~$ files are transient Office owner/lock temp
# files. Declaring them here makes the intent explicit and keeps eligibility a
# pure function of the tracked/un-ignored corpus for all future growth.
determinism-evidence/
